    { "id": "t1-bg", "type": "shape", "shape": "rect", "x": 50, "y": 124, "w": 570, "h": 206, "fill": "#10182c", "radius": 12, "stroke": "rgba(148,163,184,0.14)", "strokeWidth": 1, "group": "A", "shadow": { "y": 8, "blur": 22, "color": "rgba(2,6,18,0.45)" }, "fx": { "enter": "fade-up", "order": 1 } },
    { "id": "t1-num", "type": "shape", "shape": "rect", "x": 74, "y": 142, "w": 46, "h": 46, "fill": "rgba(79,141,255,0.14)", "radius": 10, "group": "A" },
    { "id": "t1-num-t", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 142, "w": 46, "h": 46, "html": "1", "fontSize": 22, "fontWeight": 800, "color": "#4f8dff", "fontFamily": "'JetBrains Mono', monospace", "align": "center", "valign": "middle", "group": "A", "fx": { "enter": "fade", "order": 1 } },
    { "id": "t1-title", "type": "text", "x": 134, "y": 142, "w": 462, "h": 46, "html": "<b>从单 Agent 到多 Agent 编排</b>", "fontSize": 18, "fontWeight": 700, "color": "#f1f5f9", "align": "left", "valign": "middle", "group": "A", "fx": { "enter": "fade-up", "order": 1 } },
    { "id": "t1-desc", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 200, "w": 522, "h": 116, "html": "Claude Code Dynamic Workflows、Antigravity Agent Manager、WorkBuddy 多 Agent 编排均表明：单 Agent 已不够。下一个战场是让 AI 像团队一样协作 — 规划者、执行者、审查者分工配合。多 Agent 平台预计 2035 年达 <b>$391B</b>。", "fontSize": 12.5, "color": "#94a3b8", "align": "left", "valign": "top", "lineHeight": 1.7, "group": "A", "fx": { "enter": "fade-up", "order": 2 } },
    { "id": "t2-bg", "type": "shape", "shape": "rect", "x": 660, "y": 124, "w": 570, "h": 206, "fill": "#10182c", "radius": 12, "stroke": "rgba(148,163,184,0.14)", "strokeWidth": 1, "group": "B", "shadow": { "y": 8, "blur": 22, "color": "rgba(2,6,18,0.45)" }, "fx": { "enter": "fade-up", "order": 2 } },
    { "id": "t2-num", "type": "shape", "shape": "rect", "x": 684, "y": 142, "w": 46, "h": 46, "fill": "rgba(167,139,250,0.14)", "radius": 10, "group": "B" },
    { "id": "t2-num-t", "type": "text", "x": 684, "y": 142, "w": 46, "h": 46, "html": "2", "fontSize": 22, "fontWeight": 800, "color": "#a78bfa", "fontFamily": "'JetBrains Mono', monospace", "align": "center", "valign": "middle", "group": "B", "fx": { "enter": "fade", "order": 2 } },
    { "id": "t2-title", "type": "text", "x": 744, "y": 142, "w": 462, "h": 46, "html": "<b>模型趋同，Harness 决胜</b>", "fontSize": 18, "fontWeight": 700, "color": "#f1f5f9", "align": "left", "valign": "middle", "group": "B", "fx": { "enter": "fade-up", "order": 2 } },
    { "id": "t2-desc", "type": "text", "x": 684, "y": 200, "w": 522, "h": 116, "html": "Opus 4.8 vs GPT-5.5 vs Gemini 3.5 — 前沿模型能力已收敛。竞争焦点从「谁更聪明」转向「谁的包装更好用」：Hook 系统、Skills 生态、MCP 集成、权限控制、多端连续性成为真正差异化因素。", "fontSize": 12.5, "color": "#94a3b8", "align": "left", "valign": "top", "lineHeight": 1.7, "group": "B", "fx": { "enter": "fade-up", "order": 3 } },
    { "id": "t3-bg", "type": "shape", "shape": "rect", "x": 50, "y": 346, "w": 570, "h": 206, "fill": "#10182c", "radius": 12, "stroke": "rgba(148,163,184,0.14)", "strokeWidth": 1, "group": "C", "shadow": { "y": 8, "blur": 22, "color": "rgba(2,6,18,0.45)" }, "fx": { "enter": "fade-up", "order": 3 } },
    { "id": "t3-num", "type": "shape", "shape": "rect", "x": 74, "y": 364, "w": 46, "h": 46, "fill": "rgba(34,211,238,0.14)", "radius": 10, "group": "C" },
    { "id": "t3-num-t", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 364, "w": 46, "h": 46, "html": "3", "fontSize": 22, "fontWeight": 800, "color": "#22d3ee", "fontFamily": "'JetBrains Mono', monospace", "align": "center", "valign": "middle", "group": "C", "fx": { "enter": "fade", "order": 3 } },
    { "id": "t3-title", "type": "text", "x": 134, "y": 364, "w": 462, "h": 46, "html": "<b>Sandbox 与安全成为标配</b>", "fontSize": 18, "fontWeight": 700, "color": "#f1f5f9", "align": "left", "valign": "middle", "group": "C", "fx": { "enter": "fade-up", "order": 3 } },
    { "id": "t3-desc", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 422, "w": 522, "h": 116, "html": "Codex 内核级沙箱（Seatbelt / bubblewrap）、Copilot Cloud Agent 防火墙、Devin 隔离 VM — 安全不再是可选项。模型默认关闭网络、文件访问需审批、沙箱化执行成为行业基准。", "fontSize": 12.5, "color": "#94a3b8", "align": "left", "valign": "top", "lineHeight": 1.7, "group": "C", "fx": { "enter": "fade-up", "order": 4 } },
    { "id": "t4-bg", "type": "shape", "shape": "rect", "x": 660, "y": 346, "w": 570, "h": 206, "fill": "#10182c", "radius": 12, "stroke": "rgba(148,163,184,0.14)", "strokeWidth": 1, "group": "D", "shadow": { "y": 8, "blur": 22, "color": "rgba(2,6,18,0.45)" }, "fx": { "enter": "fade-up", "order": 4 } },
    { "id": "t4-num", "type": "shape", "shape": "rect", "x": 684, "y": 364, "w": 46, "h": 46, "fill": "rgba(52,211,153,0.14)", "radius": 10, "group": "D" },
    { "id": "t4-num-t", "type": "text", "x": 684, "y": 364, "w": 46, "h": 46, "html": "4", "fontSize": 22, "fontWeight": 800, "color": "#34d399", "fontFamily": "'JetBrains Mono', monospace", "align": "center", "valign": "middle", "group": "D", "fx": { "enter": "fade", "order": 4 } },
    { "id": "t4-title", "type": "text", "x": 744, "y": 364, "w": 462, "h": 46, "html": "<b>中国厂商加速追赶</b>", "fontSize": 18, "fontWeight": 700, "color": "#f1f5f9", "align": "left", "valign": "middle", "group": "D", "fx": { "enter": "fade-up", "order": 4 } },
    { "id": "t4-desc", "type": "text", "x": 684, "y": 422, "w": 522, "h": 116, "html": "WorkBuddy 90 天登顶中国区第一、Trae 开源 Agent、通义灵码测评领衔 — 中国厂商在办公场景集成（微信/企业微信/飞书）和中文优化上建立独特壁垒。「消息驱动 Agent」模式可能为全球提供新范式。", "fontSize": 12.5, "color": "#94a3b8", "align": "left", "valign": "top", "lineHeight": 1.7, "group": "D", "fx": { "enter": "fade-up", "order": 5 } },
